{"thread":{"threadID":4157,"boardID":166,"topic":"MG Map Vorschläge","time":1486418808,"userID":262,"username":"Deagletrix","lastPostTime":1486584258,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":5,"views":498,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":2},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":61224,"threadID":4157,"userID":262,"username":"Deagletrix","subject":"MG Map Vorschläge","time":1486418808,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486420489,"value":1},{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486442192,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/192243\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/194120\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/193896\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/189285\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/168606\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wär nice wenn die maps in den server kommen würen vorallem ski_mountain dann wär es wie in alten zeiten in CSS</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MFG Deagletrix</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61225,"threadID":4157,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1486420322,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","time":1486420508,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Bitte hier die Anleitung von <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a> lesen. Zuerst die Maps aber lokal auf Abstürze etc. testen:<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/3259-wie-schlage-ich-am-besten-maps-vor/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Wie schlage ich am besten Maps vor?</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61228,"threadID":4157,"userID":2418,"username":"Neo","subject":"","time":1486428091,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","time":1486428701,"value":1},{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486442194,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Finde die 2. von dir vorgeschlagene Map nicht so kuhl um erhlich zu sein, die 3. ist aber sehr fluffig.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61418,"threadID":4157,"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","subject":"","time":1486435008,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2416,"username":"Road2Esel","time":1486444129,"value":1},{"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","time":1486473188,"value":1},{"userID":2418,"username":"Neo","time":1486485691,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Die 4 Karte. Da kommen alte Erinnerungen hoch.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich mag die Karte ansich selber ganz gut. Sie bietet einen (minigame mode) den man eigentlich so in Csgo nicht mehr viel sieht. Aber doch recht spass macht.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wäre dafür das die aufgenommen wird.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61422,"threadID":4157,"userID":2416,"username":"Road2Esel","subject":"","time":1486443962,"lastEditTime":1486446448,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":2416,"editor":"Road2Esel","likes":[{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486445511,"value":1},{"userID":2418,"username":"Neo","time":1486485676,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Die 4 Karte. Da kommen alte Erinnerungen hoch.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wäre dafür das die aufgenommen wird.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61516,"threadID":4157,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1486584258,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Vorschlag wurde übernommen, vielen Dank. --&gt; <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4162-changelog-08-02-2017/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Changelog - 08.02.2017</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Bitte in Zukunft trotzdem den oben genannten Ratgeber zum Vorschlagen von Maps benutzen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>#close <span class=\"missing-media\">[right*]</span></p>","polls":[]}]}